{
 "$schema": "../../schemas/ontology.schema.json",
 "kind": "resources",
 "namespace": "core",
 "version": 1,
 "note": "资源种类（01 §1.6）。账户 = (实体, 资源, 用途)。item:* 表示 world/meta/items.json 中可计量模板按 item:<模板ID> 计；生命/魔力不是资源。 源汇账户的写入权与每日预算由写入者在 server-plugin/ledger.mjs 的 declareLedgerWriter 声明（S1a）；用途是流量类别（wage、tax、fee、travel……）。",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "coin",
   "label": "货币（按政体铸币分种）",
   "family": "currency",
   "unit": "铜",
   "note": "铸币族的上位词：各政体、各金属的铸币各是一种资源（money 事实：metal、fineness、issuer、coinage），没有固定换算（15 §15.3）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "coin_river",
   "label": "西陲铜钱（本地记账铜钱，S1a 起入账本）",
   "family": "currency",
   "unit": "文",
   "broader": "coin",
   "money": {
    "metal": "copper",
    "fineness": 1,
    "issuer": "西陲河谷",
    "coinage": "coinage_river"
   },
   "ledger": true,
   "note": "rules.economy.credit.coinages 的 coinage_river；角色钱袋、公账、公库、托管里的铜钱都是它。账户键 <实体>|coin_river|<用途>。"
  },
  {
   "id": "coin_civic",
   "label": "阶庭方孔钱",
   "family": "currency",
   "unit": "枚",
   "broader": "coin",
   "money": {
    "metal": "copper",
    "fineness": 0.9,
    "issuer": "中陆诸邦",
    "coinage": "coinage_civic",
    "item": "item_coin_civic"
   },
   "note": "仍按物品 item_coin_civic 记在行囊与钱庄库存，S1b 随物品迁入账本。"
  },
  {
   "id": "coin_coast",
   "label": "泊绳银片",
